  "title": "The knot's amplitude is five per handle times Tutte's number per planar piece",
  "subject": "The knot's exactness factor on its three-fold spaces: the number by which a gadget reproduces the law",
  "conclusion": "On every three-fold space the knot's exactness factor is (-1)^(n-1) times a product over the pieces of the space: 5 for each Fano atom (each handle of its surface), 1 for each doubled square, and for each planar piece of glue Tutte's tree-trinity number, the spanning trees of a map for omnitruncation glue. Across a tight cut the count of colourings factors exactly, through a point lemma.",
